# 📚 CRUD Summary

| Operation | SQL Command | Purpose             |
| --------- | ----------- | ------------------- |
| CREATE    | `INSERT`    | New data add કરવો   |
| READ      | `SELECT`    | Data display કરવો   |
| UPDATE    | `UPDATE`    | Existing data બદલવો |
| DELETE    | `DELETE`    | Data remove કરવો    |

